  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 718f67b7b841dde4a89478ad5ef11627, type: 3}
  m_Name: Dialogue_Ch1_2_House
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Zmywak.Narrative::Zmywak.Narrative.Dialogue.DialogueGraph
  startNodeId: house_1
  nodes:
  - nodeId: house_1
    lines:
    - speakerId: narrator
      language: 0
      text: "Marek za\u0142atwi\u0142 pok\xF3j. W\u0142a\u015Bciwie: miejsce. Dom w Phibsborough, dwa pi\u0119tra, jedna \u0142azienka, dziewi\u0119\u0107 os\xF3b."
    - speakerId: marek
      language: 0
      text: "To jest Tomek, \u015Bpi po nocce, nie budzi\u0107. To Agnieszka, studiuje angielski. Na g\xF3rze Darius i jego brat, z Kowna. Reszta zmienia si\u0119 co tydzie\u0144."
    - speakerId: agnieszka
      language: 0
      text: "Cze\u015B\u0107! Jak chcesz, mog\u0119 ci\u0119 wieczorami uczy\u0107 s\u0142\xF3wek. W zamian zmywasz po mnie kubki. \u017Bartuj\u0119. Troch\u0119."
    - speakerId: darius
      language: 1
      text: What's the craic, man? Welcome to the madhouse.
    teachVocabularyWords:
    - welcome
    - man
    unlockSlangIds:
    - slang_craic
    setFlags: []
    outcome:
      moneyEuros: 0
      energy: 0
      homesickness: 0
      integration: 0
    choices: []
    branchIfFlag: 
    branchNodeId: 
    nextNodeId: house_landlady
  - nodeId: house_landlady
    lines:
    - speakerId: byrne
      language: 1
      text: You're the new one? Rent is on Friday. Cash. And no new names on the lease, love, I don't want trouble.
    - speakerId: kuba_thought
      language: 0
      text: "Pytam \u0142amanym angielskim, czy mimo wszystko wpisze mnie do umowy."
    - speakerId: byrne
      language: 1
      text: Put you on the lease? I will, yeah.
    - speakerId: kuba_thought
      language: 0
      text: "Powiedzia\u0142a \"tak\". Marek parska \u015Bmiechem. Okazuje si\u0119, \u017Ce w Irlandii \"I will, yeah\" znaczy \"po moim trupie\"."
    teachVocabularyWords:
    - rent
    - friday
    - cash
    - new
    - names
    unlockSlangIds:
    - slang_i_will_yeah
    setFlags:
    - ch1_no_lease
    outcome:
      moneyEuros: 0
      energy: 0
      homesickness: 0
      integration: 0
    choices: []
    branchIfFlag: 
    branchNodeId: 
    nextNodeId: house_bed
  - nodeId: house_bed
    lines:
    - speakerId: kuba_thought
      language: 0
      text: "Wolnego \u0142\xF3\u017Cka nie ma. Jest kanapa w salonie albo p\xF3\u0142 materaca u Tomka - za dop\u0142at\u0105 dziesi\u0119\u0107 euro."
    teachVocabularyWords: []
    unlockSlangIds: []
    setFlags: []
    outcome:
      moneyEuros: 0
      energy: 0
      homesickness: 0
      integration: 0
    choices:
    - choiceText: "\u015Api\u0119 na kanapie w salonie."
      targetNodeId: house_couch
      requiredFlag: 
    - choiceText: "Dop\u0142acam dziesi\u0119\u0107 euro za materac."
      targetNodeId: house_mattress
      requiredFlag: 
    branchIfFlag: 
    branchNodeId: 
    nextNodeId: 
  - nodeId: house_couch
    lines:
    - speakerId: kuba_thought
      language: 0
      text: "Salon to tak\u017Ce kuchnia, korytarz i kino. O drugiej w nocy kto\u015B sma\u017Cy jajecznic\u0119."
    teachVocabularyWords: []
    unlockSlangIds: []
    setFlags:
    - ch1_couch
    outcome:
      moneyEuros: 0
      energy: -10
      homesickness: 0
      integration: 0
    choices: []
    branchIfFlag: 
    branchNodeId: 
    nextNodeId: house_end
  - nodeId: house_mattress
    lines:
    - speakerId: kuba_thought
      language: 0
      text: Tomek chrapie jak betoniarka na wolnych obrotach. Ale to przynajmniej materac.
    teachVocabularyWords: []
    unlockSlangIds: []
    setFlags:
    - ch1_mattress
    outcome:
      moneyEuros: -10
      energy: 5
      homesickness: 0
      integration: 0
    choices: []
    branchIfFlag: 
    branchNodeId: 
    nextNodeId: house_end
  - nodeId: house_end
    lines:
    - speakerId: agnieszka
      language: 0
      text: "I tak w tym domu nikt nie \u015Bpi. Witaj w Dublinie!"
    - speakerId: kuba_thought
      language: 0
      text: "Dziewi\u0119\u0107 os\xF3b, jedna \u0142azienka i ani jednego nazwiska na umowie. Co\u015B mi m\xF3wi, \u017Ce to si\u0119 jeszcze zem\u015Bci."
    teachVocabularyWords: []
    unlockSlangIds: []
    setFlags: []
